{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19096","headline":"朗州窦员外见示与澧州元郎中郡斋赠答长句二篇因以继和 · 刘禹锡","name":"朗州窦员外见示与澧州元郎中郡斋赠答长句二篇因以继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸳鹭差池出建章，彩旗朱户蔚相望。\n新恩共理犬牙地，昨日同含鸡舌香。\n白芷江边分驿路，山桃蹊外接甘棠。\n应怜一罢金闺籍，枉渚逢春十度伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}